lid enemy variation throughout, especially once you hit the third \"world.\"", "timestamp_created": 1694811829, "timestamp_updated": 1694811829, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "146336375", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058917792", "personaname": "Caointean", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198058917792/", "num_games_owned": 357, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 7977, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3376, "last_played": 1782340057, "avatar": "a41301d4b9e1d39dda8f88f1c057b74f846482c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun. Better with a group, but there aren't a lot of people playing public so queue times can be long.", "timestamp_created": 1694786210, "timestamp_updated": 1694786210, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "146325360", "author": {"steamid": "76561198838848041", "personaname": "Fredee Fazbeer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/stinkyshitz777/", "num_games_owned": 26, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2438, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2438, "last_played": 1694068294, "avatar": "c53b7598c28d28a607f110bfc982caadfc404584"}, "language": "english", "review": "There is something about this game which makes inspires a potent sense of disgust inside of me. This game is like the dreamlike cacophony of every single putrid obsession of some hentai addicted, scoliated imbecile. The game-play, or art-style, are nothing special, and can be thought of as essentially being copied from other games. If you are dreadfully bored of the drought of cooperative, rogue-like, looter-shooters, which cease to saturate the gaming market, you may be able to justify buying this. This game runs like poo poo. You will play it for dozens of hours, then leave it whilst begrudgingly declining to acknowledge the regret you have from purchasing it in the first place.", "timestamp_created": 1694770604, "timestamp_updated": 1694771675, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.347053676843643188", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "146305232", "author": {"steamid": "76561199070813842", "personaname": "ReddPotato", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199070813842/", "num_games_owned": 324, "num_reviews": 47, "playtime_forever": 2914, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1465, "last_played": 1780278027, "avatar": "098cd5dc929ae56eb627bc556177867f18cbd31d"}, "language": "english", "review": "i feel my sanity slipping", "timestamp_created": 1694731888, "timestamp_updated": 1694731888, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}